  "correct_approach": "Execute pressBrakePedal(1.0)→lockDoors→startEngine exactly once atomically per delta2/delta36/delta38. Avoid retry loops within a turn; if a call fails, diagnose and proceed with dependent operations using available state. Narrative summaries are acceptable post-execution but should not mask redundant tool invocations.",
